# /usr/lib/tmpfiles.d/w2c-domain.conf — the directory of the signer's tokens socket, on the server that holds the domain.
# setgid to the books' worker's group: the socket the signer (w2c) makes there is 0660 and takes that group, so
# `vms-domainpart` (vms, in vms-vmsdomain) opens it and nothing else of the box does. The signer's other door and the
# console's are their units' own `RuntimeDirectory=` (0700).
d /run/w2c-signer 2750 w2c vms-vmsdomain -
